  "label": "User projected onto the child in the image",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the child depicted in the visual material, as the child is the subject of the question 'mommy, why am i getting christmas presents in august?'. The use of 'i' in the text directly maps the user's perspective onto the child's perspective, making the viewer identify with the child's emotional state and question. The child's crying and distressed expression further reinforce this projection, inviting the user to empathize with the child's confusion and vulnerability.",
